[{"id":"regiment62-0","name":"1st Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1936 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 991\r\n— cavalry: 786\r\n— infantry: 1671."},{"id":"regiment62-1","name":"2nd Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1750 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— infantry: 1611\r\n— archers: 790\r\n— cavalry: 915."},{"id":"regiment62-2","name":"3rd Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1780 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— infantry: 1103\r\n— archers: 630\r\n— cavalry: 521."},{"id":"regiment62-3","name":"4th Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1964 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 417\r\n— cavalry: 347\r\n— infantry: 603."},{"id":"regiment62-4","name":"5th (Colonie Colonie) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1906 Bucking Era. 5th (Colonie Colonie) Regiment is stationed in Colonie Colonie. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 260\r\n— cavalry: 155\r\n— infantry: 388."},{"id":"regiment62-5","name":"6th (Quoueta-Et-Milenniar-Dimensional) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1913 Bucking Era. 6th (Quoueta-Et-Milenniar-Dimensional) Regiment is stationed in Breaux. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— cavalry: 1\r\n— infantry: 1\r\n— archers: 1."},{"id":"regiment85-0","name":"1st Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1982 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 448\r\n— cavalry: 70\r\n— infantry: 368."},{"id":"regiment89-0","name":"1st (Breischwei) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 2019 Bucking Era. 1st (Breischwei) Regiment is stationed in Breischwei. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— infantry: 26\r\n— archers: 14\r\n— cavalry: 12."},{"id":"regiment90-0","name":"1st Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1896 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 29\r\n— infantry: 25\r\n— cavalry: 4."},{"id":"regiment96-0","name":"1st (Marcio) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1882 Bucking Era. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 2603\r\n— cavalry: 399\r\n— infantry: 2145\r\n— artillery: 179."},{"id":"regiment96-1","name":"2nd (Fleuri) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1804 Bucking Era. 2nd (Fleuri) Regiment is stationed in Port-Aux-Souverains. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 2025 BE:\r\n— archers: 1586\r\n— cavalry: 771\r\n— infantry: 2041\r\n— artillery: 40."},{"id":"marker0","name":"Haut-Plateau-Toutouïen","legend":"<p>Ville la plus vieille connue, anciennement connue sous le nom de \"La Capitale Antique\" elle est divis&eacute;e en 3 r&eacute;gions administratives; Warwick, Chihuahua et Colossal. Elle date de la fondation de l'&Eacute;talie datant du 30 septembre 2024, mais certains scientifiques ont des preuves que la date du pays pourrait dater jusqu'&agrave; encore plus longtemps. C'est le berceau du monde moderne, et monde moderne &Eacute;talois. La ville contient le premier parlement de la FIDS, anciennement connue sous le nom de l'ONPP (signifiant, l'Organisation Nationale des Pays Prot&eacute;g&eacute;s), elle poss&egrave;de l'ancien abri du Roi, ella a le vestige de la Pyramide d'Arouhin, la Statue Dor&eacute;e militaire, un vestige de la dictature de Kondor qui est sa chambre de torture o&ugrave; les traitres &eacute;taient tu&eacute;s. Il poss&egrave;de aussi des b&acirc;timents secondaires mais beaucoup importants pour l'histoire du pays, les tours jumeaux qui ont &eacute;t&eacute;s victimes d'actes terroristes et aussi le premier b&acirc;timent de l'Agence Spatiale Internationale. Ce qui rend cette ville un vestige contemporain de l'&acirc;ge moderne &Eacute;talois et qui est l'histoire de lib&eacute;ration de Kondor. La FIDS nomme cette ville comme une des 10 merveilles du monde. Elle porte aussi le nom du \"Porteur de la civilisation parce qu'elle a acueillie la premi&egrave;re civilisation.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"marker1","name":"Méderrine","legend":"<p>M&eacute;derrine, capitale de Rolican mais aussi capitale qui a habit&eacute; les premiers capistes et les premi&egrave;res Capcha parce que les proph&egrave;tes &eacute;taient l&agrave; bas. &Eacute;tant une des 10e merveille du monde, il est prot&eacute;g&eacute; pour son recueil d'histoire Capiste glorifi&eacute; par une union fi&egrave;re des pays capistes qui ont approch&eacute;s &agrave; la FIDS l'adh&eacute;ration au programme de site historique prot&eacute;g&eacute;.</p>"},{"id":"marker2","name":"Newhouse (Wolfsburg)","legend":"<p>Newhouse est l'un des vestiges tr&egrave;s rares de la plan&egrave;te terre, elle a &eacute;t&eacute;e conquise par les anglais puis apr&egrave;s par les &Eacute;taliens, elle est aussi le berceaux du Premier R&egrave;gne (Ernest Herrschaft) qui l'a renomm&eacute; Wolfsburg&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"regiment96-2","name":"3rd (Prisoñia) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 2019 Bucking Era. 3rd (Prisoñia) Regiment is stationed in Prisoñia Province de la Colonia Colón-Romácia. "},{"id":"regiment96-3","name":"4th (Agort) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1971 Bucking Era. 4th (Agort) Regiment is stationed in Korsk-Cadic. "},{"id":"regiment96-4","name":"5th (Gibaltage) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1857 Bucking Era. 5th (Gibaltage) Regiment is stationed in Nom original; Jabal Jaleedi - Nom italianisé: Gibaltage - Nom Officiel: Quadèrnitophanilorezque. "},{"id":"regiment96-5","name":"6th (Pruxe-Slamique) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1753 Bucking Era. 6th (Pruxe-Slamique) Regiment is stationed in Angerce. "},{"id":"regiment96-6","name":"7th (Quoueta-Et-Milenniar-Étalois) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 1931 Bucking Era. 7th (Quoueta-Et-Milenniar-Étalois) Regiment is stationed in Duc de Forquoueta. "},{"id":"regiment96-7","name":"8th (Nouvelle-Étalie) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 2019 Bucking Era. 8th (Nouvelle-Étalie) Regiment is stationed in No